title: "UMST Manifold: A Differentiable Spatiotemporal Manifold"
abstract: "The Unified Material-State Tensor (UMST) Manifold is a substrate for differentiable physics. Material configurations are represented as cellular sheaves over a graph, ensuring flows of mass, heat, and stress are conservatively governed by topological operators."
